{% block main %}
    <h1>Census Test 2027 is here</h1>
    <p>Census Test 2027 is a data-collection exercise that will help us prepare for Census 2031. We’ve asked people in halls of residence in Cardiff and Newcastle to complete a form, and what we learn will help us prepare for Census 2031.</p>
    <h2>Complete your form now</h2>
    <p>The Census Test is open. It should take you around 10 minutes to complete your form.</p>
    {{
        onsButton({
            "text": "Start Census Test",
            "classes": "ons-u-mt-l",
            "url": pageInfo.rootPath + "/address.html"
        })
    }}
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">Who should take part?</h2>
    <p>Everyone living in halls of residence should take part, including UK and international students, and people who are living in halls but not studying at university.</p>
    <p>If you do not live in halls of residence, but have been selected to take part, visit the <a href="#0">main Census Test 2027 web page</a> to find out more.</p>
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">Why you should take part</h2>
    <p><strong>Your response matters</strong></p>
    <p>Your answers will help us improve Census 2031 so more students in halls of residence complete it. We’ve previously had difficulty engaging students, so your involvement in the test will help us meet your needs.</p>
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">Help us build a better census</h2>
    <p>By taking part in the test, you’ll help us improve the census for 2031 and ensure that we ask you the right questions.</p>
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">Your information is secure</h2>
    <p>We keep your data safe, secure and confidential, and have a legal obligation to protect personal information.</p>
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">Information and support</h2>
    <p><a href="#0">About the Census Test 2027</a></p>
    <p>What the test is, why students living in halls of residence have been selected to take part, and how it will help us deliver Census 2031.</p>
    <p><a href="#0">Privacy and data protection</a></p>
    <p>Why you can trust us with your data, and how we store and process your information securely.</p>
    <p><a href="#0">Contact us</a></p>
    <p>Get help with completing your form, request a paper version and access our support for other languages.</p>
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">If you live in Scotland or Northern Ireland</h2>
    <p>If you live in Scotland or Northern Ireland, visit the <a href="#0">Scotland census test website</a> and the <a href="#0">Northern Ireland census test website</a> respectively to take part.</p>
